WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:02.210
[4 years ago]

3
00:29.320 --> 00:31.800
He may not be able to draw again.

4
00:42.440 --> 00:44.240
Please...

5
00:47.010 --> 00:50.050
Please, stay away from him.

6
00:51.310 --> 00:53.570
If you stay,

7
00:53.570 --> 00:55.540
he will break.

8
01:03.800 --> 01:05.110
Lun...

9
01:14.580 --> 01:16.140
You're awake?

10
01:17.010 --> 01:18.610
Do you want to sit up?

11
01:51.000 --> 01:53.010
What do you know?

12
01:53.740 --> 01:56.550
I knew about the man named Lun.

13
01:57.100 --> 01:59.120
Did you also know about 203?

14
01:59.860 --> 02:01.530
Yeah.

15
02:01.530 --> 02:03.180
For how long?

16
02:03.180 --> 02:05.530
Since before we started dating.

17
02:06.320 --> 02:09.020
Why didn't you ever tell me?

18
02:09.650 --> 02:12.450
Because you said you didn't want to remember.

19
02:12.450 --> 02:14.980
- Me? - Yeah.

20
02:16.590 --> 02:21.520
Your mother also asked me not to force the knowledge onto you.

21
02:21.520 --> 02:24.070
Even if I asked to know?

22
02:26.520 --> 02:30.300
We thought if you remembered, you'd only suffer again.

23
02:33.550 --> 02:36.480
That's...

24
02:38.690 --> 02:41.600
That's not your decision to make.

25
02:46.310 --> 02:47.810
I'm sorry.

26
02:54.220 --> 02:56.720
We lived here, together.

27
03:03.240 --> 03:04.680
Did you know that, too?

28
03:04.680 --> 03:06.050
Yeah.

29
03:06.940 --> 03:09.010
How much do you know?

30
03:10.380 --> 03:11.480
Not everything.

31
03:11.480 --> 03:13.770
Then what don't you know?

32
03:15.800 --> 03:19.820
I don't know what happened the day of the accident.

33
03:23.020 --> 03:24.610
The accident?

34
03:25.340 --> 03:28.020
That's what you're trying to recall, right?

35
03:46.940 --> 03:48.800
Did you sleep?

36
03:51.010 --> 03:52.780
A bit.

37
03:53.640 --> 03:55.410
Liar.

38
04:16.200 --> 04:19.070
I was always by your side.

39
04:19.070 --> 04:21.440
Nights you couldn't sleep,

40
04:22.780 --> 04:24.850
days you couldn't paint, always.

41
04:27.920 --> 04:30.200
But she forgot you.

42
04:31.810 --> 04:34.240
She forgot, and adopted a new life.

43
04:37.900 --> 04:40.080
Even though you forgot,

44
04:42.600 --> 04:45.870
you've never really gotten over her.

45
04:51.680 --> 04:53.420
I know.

46
05:01.760 --> 05:04.440
I know how important she is to you.

47
05:09.230 --> 05:11.210
But all I want...

48
05:12.480 --> 05:17.040
is for you to live.

49
05:20.520 --> 05:23.690
I don't mind if you become unable to paint.

50
05:26.190 --> 05:28.380
As long as you live,

51
05:30.200 --> 05:32.050
it's enough for me.

52
05:37.860 --> 05:39.450
Lun.

53
05:43.610 --> 05:45.720
Please. Stay with me.

54
05:55.610 --> 05:58.240
Don't see her anymore.

55
06:09.060 --> 06:10.620
Alright.

56
06:10.620 --> 06:12.120
Really?

57
06:13.770 --> 06:15.910
I won't see her anymore.

58
06:19.750 --> 06:21.130
That's great.

59
06:32.400 --> 06:34.750
They're not coming out.

60
06:34.750 --> 06:37.520
- Too bad. - Yeah.

61
06:37.520 --> 06:40.760
I really wanted to get a picture with the pandas...

62
06:40.760 --> 06:44.080
Why not try waiting a bit longer?

63
06:48.120 --> 06:51.090
It's not so bad, sitting and waiting.

64
06:51.800 --> 06:53.960
Yeah, it feels nice.

65
07:03.610 --> 07:05.100
There they are!

66
07:12.220 --> 07:14.270
How unusual.

67
07:14.270 --> 07:15.460
What?

68
07:15.460 --> 07:17.980
You're making a terrifying face.

69
07:18.840 --> 07:20.380
Am I?

70
07:23.110 --> 07:24.760
Your girlfriend?

71
07:26.500 --> 07:28.100
Yeah.

72
07:29.440 --> 07:33.840
Oh, to have someone worry for you. She's a lucky girl.

73
07:35.750 --> 07:38.360
It doesn't feel great to be the one worrying though.

74
07:39.370 --> 07:43.180
"Worry" is such a convenient word.

75
07:44.060 --> 07:47.170
It lets you hide away your fears.

76
07:47.170 --> 07:48.740
But I am scared.

77
07:53.180 --> 07:54.830
Of what?

78
07:57.450 --> 08:00.650
Not of Sakura remembering.

79
08:00.650 --> 08:04.900
But of her remembering, and not choose me.

80
08:04.900 --> 08:06.220
Then tell her.

81
08:06.220 --> 08:07.930
If I did, I'd be tying her down.

82
08:07.930 --> 08:12.410
You already are, with how worried you're acting.

83
08:14.500 --> 08:18.060
Just because you're close, doesn't mean you'll be chosen.

84
08:18.060 --> 08:19.780
What's that supposed to mean?

85
08:20.580 --> 08:22.680
I'm just making a general observation.

86
08:24.710 --> 08:29.430
If you want to be chosen, at least tell her the truth.

87
08:34.040 --> 08:38.630
She forgot, and adopted a new life.

88
08:42.530 --> 08:44.530
Sakura...

89
08:49.400 --> 08:51.550
Please. Stay with me.

90
08:54.560 --> 08:58.170
I won't... see her anymore.

91
09:42.520 --> 09:46.050
[Soak dishes in water before washing] [Don't put away damp laundry]

92
09:46.050 --> 09:49.720
[Buy coffee beans before we run out] [White pepper soup, only on rainy days]

93
09:53.900 --> 09:56.000
[On days Lun can't draw, make soup] [Add extra white pepper]

94
09:56.000 --> 09:57.950
[On days Lun can't draw, make soup] [Add extra white pepper]

95
09:57.950 --> 10:02.140
[On rainy days, we go here]

96
10:10.550 --> 10:12.330
Here you go.

97
10:15.170 --> 10:16.920
Are you okay?

98
10:16.920 --> 10:18.300
Spicy!

99
10:18.300 --> 10:20.440
- Spicy? - Yes!

100
10:33.830 --> 10:35.610
You alone?

101
10:38.010 --> 10:39.420
Coffee?

102
10:39.920 --> 10:41.510
Yes.

103
10:57.220 --> 10:58.820
What's this?

104
10:58.820 --> 11:00.720
I don't know.

105
11:10.520 --> 11:12.730
I'm keeping it here,

106
11:12.730 --> 11:15.230
until it sells for a high price.

107
11:23.340 --> 11:24.840
"Lun"...

108
11:29.900 --> 11:32.350
What are you doing?

109
11:33.600 --> 11:35.800
Practicing my signature.

110
11:35.800 --> 11:40.060
I'm trying to perfect it, but... something's missing.

111
11:51.470 --> 11:53.000
How's that? [Lun]

112
11:54.280 --> 11:56.260
Sakura?

113
12:01.950 --> 12:04.000
Do you know this?

114
12:12.440 --> 12:14.420
Yes.

115
12:14.420 --> 12:16.400
Should I go?

116
12:17.790 --> 12:19.650
You decide.

117
12:27.900 --> 12:31.660
[Tembeling Road]

118
12:38.630 --> 12:43.030
[Eita: Want me to come get you?]

119
12:43.030 --> 12:44.060
[It's fine]

120
12:44.060 --> 12:47.600
[I have somewhere I want to stop by]

121
12:47.600 --> 12:51.850
[Eita: Okay, be careful]

122
12:57.130 --> 12:59.020
Let's get going.

123
13:02.980 --> 13:04.600
Eita?

124
13:04.600 --> 13:06.460
What's up?

125
13:06.460 --> 13:08.430
Sorry. I have to head out a bit.

126
13:08.430 --> 13:10.350
Huh? But our meeting...

127
13:10.350 --> 13:12.000
I'll be back soon.

128
14:17.020 --> 14:19.510
I had a feeling you'd be here.

129
14:19.510 --> 14:21.050
Why?

130
14:21.780 --> 14:23.160
I don't know.

131
14:23.160 --> 14:24.840
You don't?

132
14:25.610 --> 14:27.260
I don't.

133
14:35.700 --> 14:37.100
Here?

134
14:40.300 --> 14:43.400
Over there feels too far from you.

135
15:25.280 --> 15:27.050
Thank you.

136
15:34.980 --> 15:36.910
I eat first?

137
15:38.180 --> 15:40.940
I felt like you went first.

138
15:40.940 --> 15:43.640
You always say, "I feel".

139
15:44.520 --> 15:46.510
Only with you.

140
15:49.100 --> 15:53.050
Sorry. That kinda just came out.

141
16:07.300 --> 16:10.320
It's not like I want to remember, but...

142
16:12.040 --> 16:15.130
It reacts first.

143
16:15.610 --> 16:17.450
What does?

144
16:17.450 --> 16:23.160
My hands. Smells. Before I do.

145
16:24.170 --> 16:25.630
Yeah.

146
16:27.000 --> 16:28.530
Me too.

147
16:55.580 --> 16:58.190
You knew when I couldn't paint.

148
16:58.920 --> 17:00.900
Did you remember?

149
17:00.900 --> 17:02.580
No.

150
17:06.130 --> 17:08.950
I'm hurting you,

151
17:10.500 --> 17:12.600
because I don't remember.

152
17:13.920 --> 17:18.940
You still hurt, because you don't remember.

153
17:22.140 --> 17:24.060
It's cruel.

154
17:25.650 --> 17:27.150
Isn't it?

155
17:31.720 --> 17:35.810
It's cruel either way.

156
17:35.810 --> 17:38.740
Today is special secret recipe!

157
17:38.740 --> 17:42.190
What? You said yesterday was secret.

158
17:42.190 --> 17:44.410
Today is very secret!

159
17:44.410 --> 17:47.470
Okay, okay. Really secret. I won't ask.

160
17:47.470 --> 17:50.390
The secret is...

161
17:54.620 --> 17:56.480
Sakura...

162
17:56.480 --> 18:00.210
Don't say my name.

163
18:01.680 --> 18:03.280
Sorry.

164
18:07.550 --> 18:09.380
I need to get going.

165
18:11.490 --> 18:12.830
I'll walk you home.

166
18:12.830 --> 18:14.740
Don't.

167
18:18.490 --> 18:20.170
Please, don't.

168
18:57.270 --> 18:58.850
Sorry.

169
19:00.500 --> 19:02.820
My body just reacted.

170
19:02.820 --> 19:05.120
That's why I'm scared.

171
19:08.750 --> 19:10.940
I have Eita.

172
19:11.740 --> 19:13.740
I know.

173
19:13.740 --> 19:15.800
You, too.

174
19:15.800 --> 19:17.360
Yeah.

175
19:17.360 --> 19:22.300
So we have to stop here.

176
19:22.300 --> 19:26.020
Even if we remember.

177
19:26.020 --> 19:28.430
We'll just hurt someone.

178
19:29.360 --> 19:30.960
Maybe.

179
19:31.570 --> 19:33.080
Maybe...

180
19:34.380 --> 19:36.430
But when I'm with you,

181
19:37.530 --> 19:39.700
I don't need to paint.

182
19:40.740 --> 19:42.440
What do you mean?

183
19:43.840 --> 19:45.410
I don't know.

184
19:47.030 --> 19:49.820
But for the first time in my life,

185
19:49.820 --> 19:52.720
I can look at you, and not paint you.

186
20:20.800 --> 20:22.970
You should go home.

187
20:30.080 --> 20:31.670
I know.

188
20:39.210 --> 20:40.800
Sakura!

189
20:40.800 --> 20:42.340
I said, don't call my...

190
20:42.340 --> 20:44.800
I'm glad I met you now.

191
20:44.800 --> 20:46.940
Not the you from before.

192
20:48.770 --> 20:51.010
I like who you are now!

193
20:53.200 --> 20:55.210
That's playing dirty.

194
20:58.390 --> 21:00.640
I haven't remembered a thing.

195
21:01.620 --> 21:04.170
I don't even understand.

196
21:05.200 --> 21:06.970
So why...

197
21:07.750 --> 21:10.540
Why does it hurt more now?

198
21:15.560 --> 21:17.350
Sakura.

199
21:18.570 --> 21:21.150
It's not as though I remember.

200
21:26.200 --> 21:31.120
But right now, I...

201
22:12.810 --> 22:14.200
Sorry.

202
22:16.210 --> 22:18.190
Don't apologize.

203
22:20.010 --> 22:24.390
If you say sorry, it feels like a mistake.

204
22:35.260 --> 22:36.900
I'm going home.

205
22:48.950 --> 22:56.990
[Next]
